  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetInventoryName(InventoryType: number, Index: number): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llGetInventoryName(integer InventoryType, integer Index);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is the name of the inventory item <b>number</b> of <b>type</b>. Returns an empty string if no item of the specified type is found in the prim&#39;s inventory (or there are less than or equal to <b>number</b> items of the type).</p>
</p>
